{"id":"desafortunado","lemma":"desafortunado","pos":"adj","rank":4398,"glosses":["without luck; unfortunate"],"ipa":"/desafoɾtuˈnado/","forms":{"feminine":"desafortunada","masculinePlural":"desafortunados","femininePlural":"desafortunadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fe/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-desafortunado.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Soy tan desafortunado!","en":"I'm so unlucky!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440930","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"so, as"},null]},{"text":"Fue un error desafortunado.","en":"It was an unfortunate mistake.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519087","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"error"},null]},{"text":"Yo no era desafortunado.","en":"I wasn't unlucky.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442825","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Ella simpatizó con aquellas desafortunadas personas.","en":"She sympathized with those unfortunate people.","words":[{"g":"she"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"that (over there","l":"aquel"},null,{"g":"person (an individual","l":"persona"}]},{"text":"Fue desafortunado que lloviera ayer.","en":"It was unfortunate that it rained yesterday.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to rain","l":"llover"},{"g":"yesterday"}]}]}